{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vpM9h1n4WL1793573256.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>上海10月二手房網簽按年上升三成三，市場止跌回暖信號已經明確。</p><p></p><p>據上海市房地產交易中心官網數據顯示，10月上海二手房累計網簽2.4萬套，超越9月約2.35萬套的成交，按年大升三成三，創近六年同期成交新高。據代理表示，隨著政策持續落地，樓市逐步企穩，購房者心態轉變。之前不少潛在買家因擔憂房價繼續下行，選擇觀望。</p><p></p><p>隨著上海二手住宅價格連續多月錄得按月上升，市場止跌回暖的信號已經明確。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:43.345990+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T22:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T14:38:17.876199+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:43.049873+00:00","content_hash":"de593c67b283a5d1f5ca2a69d84653e079448dc15d50754a97f05ac82b76d8a2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:43.345990+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}